    <mk:eventTitle rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Shinnok's War Against Edenia and Heaven</mk:eventTitle>
    <mk:eventSummary rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Aided by the traitor Tanya, Shinnok escapes the Netherrealm, conquering Edenia and assaulting the Heavens before Raiden and Liu Kang repel him.</mk:eventSummary>
